---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site, sara, kevin, links } from "../data/site";
---

<Base
  title="Meet Sara + Kevin Russell | Austin Real Estate Agents"
  description="Meet Sara and Kevin Russell — Austin real estate agents with Holt Residential Group at Compass, serving buyers, sellers, and renters across Austin and surrounding areas."
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section class="relative flex items-end overflow-hidden bg-ink">
    <img
      src="/austin-lake.jpg"
      alt="Austin, Texas"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-40"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-ink/60 to-ink"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 pt-48 pb-16 lg:px-10">
      <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.35em] text-gold-light uppercase">
        Austin Real Estate Experts
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-5xl text-white md:text-7xl">Meet Sara + Kevin</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Team intro -->
  <section class="bg-cream">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-14 px-6 py-24 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-10">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.3em] text-gold uppercase">
          {site.brokerage} at {site.broker}
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl leading-tight md:text-5xl">
          A husband-and-wife team, diligently guiding you home.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70 md:text-base">
          Sara and Kevin Russell combine deep local knowledge with a hospitality-driven,
          client-first approach. With nearly two decades of Austin life, they focus on the
          downtown Austin condo market and the neighborhoods south of Lady Bird Lake — and
          serve buyers, sellers, and renters across Austin and the surrounding areas.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70 md:text-base">
          They operate their business by the Golden Rule: clear communication, honest
          guidance, and genuine relationship building on every transaction.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href={sara.phoneHref}
            class="bg-gold px-8 py-3.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-white uppercase transition-colors hover:bg-gold-light"
          >
            Let's Connect
          </a>
          <a
            href={links.instagram}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="border border-ink px-8 py-3.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] uppercase transition-colors hover:bg-ink hover:text-white"
          >
            @russellhomesatx
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img
        src="/russell-family.webp"
        alt="The Russell family"
        class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Sara bio -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-start gap-14 px-6 py-24 lg:grid-cols-5 lg:px-10">
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <img
          src={sara.headshot}
          alt="Sara Russell"
          class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover"
        />
        <div class="mt-6">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl">{sara.name}</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold uppercase">
            {sara.title} | Compass
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink/80">
            <li>
              M: <a href={sara.phoneHref} class="hover:text-gold">{sara.phone}</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href={`mailto:${sara.email}`} class="hover:text-gold">{sara.email}</a>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href={sara.compassUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-5 inline-block border border-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-colors hover:bg-ink hover:text-white"
          >
            Compass Profile
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70 md:text-base lg:col-span-3">
        <p>
          Sara Russell came to real estate the same way she approached her 15 years in
          education: with a genuine desire to help people navigate something that matters
          deeply to them.
        </p>
        <p>
          After more than 25 years calling Austin home, Sara brings something no amount of
          sales experience can manufacture. She has watched neighborhoods transform, seen
          families put down roots, and witnessed Austin evolve into one of the most dynamic
          real estate markets in the country. That perspective shapes how she listens to
          clients, how she thinks about value, and how she advises on decisions that go
          beyond price per square foot.
        </p>
        <p>
          Her time in the classroom built skills that translate directly into real estate:
          breaking down complex information into clear next steps, staying calm when the
          stakes are high, and never losing sight of the person in front of her. Buying or
          selling a home is one of the most significant decisions most people make, and Sara
          treats it that way. Sara is committed to showing up fully prepared and deeply
          attentive for every client she works with.
        </p>
        <p>
          When she is not working, Sara can be found exploring Austin's restaurant scene,
          traveling with her family, cheering on her teenagers, or getting lost in a good
          book.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Kevin bio -->
  <section class="bg-cream">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-start gap-14 px-6 py-24 lg:grid-cols-5 lg:px-10">
      <div class="space-y-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70 md:text-base lg:order-2 lg:col-span-3">
        <p>
          Kevin Russell initially whet his appetite for real estate while watching his older
          brother develop large multifamily apartments at a national level. He holds an
          Advertising degree from the University of Illinois and found himself drawn to
          hospitality soon after university — holding guest service positions with Hilton,
          Fairmont, and the Four Seasons brand of hotels and residences.
        </p>
        <p>
          Kevin took those hospitality skills to a role with the sales team at the Austin
          Proper Residences, giving him a glimpse into Austin's real estate development world.
          He now works with Holt Residential Group at Compass, focusing on the downtown Austin
          condo market and the neighborhoods south of Lady Bird Lake.
        </p>
        <p>
          A former endurance athlete with multiple Ironman finishes, Kevin is a 2x Boston
          Marathon finisher and 3x NYC Marathon qualifier. He knows what it means to start
          something and see it through to completion at a high level — whether that's a race
          or the buying and selling of a home, he meets every transaction with diligence.
        </p>
        <p>
          Kevin lives in South Austin with his wife Sara and their two children — plus an old,
          grumpy bulldog named Earl. He enjoys family time, camping, boating, and vintage cars
          and motorcycles.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:order-1 lg:col-span-2">
        <img
          src={kevin.headshot}
          alt="Kevin Russell"
          class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover"
        />
        <div class="mt-6">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl">{kevin.name}</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold uppercase">
            {kevin.title} | Compass
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink/80">
            <li>
              M: <a href={kevin.phoneHref} class="hover:text-gold">{kevin.phone}</a>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href={kevin.compassUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-5 inline-block border border-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase transition-colors hover:bg-ink hover:text-white"
          >
            Compass Profile
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
